        "id": 141807,
        "name": "Natediggadoggity",
        "username": "Natediggadoggity",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/f04885/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-05-23T19:15:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thinking about the pacing, and actually, 4 sounds about right, if they want to keep the variant pacing as even as possible. (if we include the mini-expansions) 4 for infernal relics, would leave 4 for mini expansion 2 (Eternal Haka, Infinite Scholar, Horus Ra, Redeemer Fanatic), 4-6 in shattered timelines (depending on if they want to save a couple for mini expansion 3), 5 in wrath of the cosmos with all the prime wardens, and then there would 2-4 left for mini expansion 3: Kvothe, Chrono-Ranger best of times, and whomever wasn't in shattered timelines, (or a new un-released one, maybe for guise or skyscraper-released as a reward at the kickstarter for the rpg?)</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
